    behind them. This is controlled with the
    ToolbarView.props.extend_content_to_top_edge and
    ToolbarView.props.extend_content_to_bottom_edge properties.

    Top and bottom bars can be hidden and revealed with an animation using the
    ToolbarView.props.reveal_top_bars and
    ToolbarView.props.reveal_bottom_bars properties.

